  "hints": [
    "Grow a window to the right, and shrink it from the left whenever it contains a repeat.",
    "Remember the last index where you saw each character.",
    "Keep start = 0 and last = {}. For each i, ch: if last.get(ch, -1) >= start, set start = last[ch] + 1. Then last[ch] = i and best = max(best, i - start + 1)."
  ],
